"""Separate overdue reminders (#221): the booking's single
``overdue_reminded_at`` becomes a counter and timestamp per kind on each
item. An item that is overdue now counts as reminded once (at that time)
when its booking was reminded on or after the day the item became overdue
for its kind, so running bookings get no burst of mails while an item that
went overdue later still gets its own reminders."""

